{
  "id": "its-always-sunny-in-philadelphia---12x05---making-dennis-reynolds-a-murderer",
  "title": "It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia - 12x05 - Making Dennis Reynolds a Murderer",
  "sourceFilename": "It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia - 12x05 - Making Dennis Reynolds a Murderer.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-20T06:02:00.860Z",
  "lineCount": 272,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Have you read where there's clowns coming to towns and scaring children?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1434,
      "endMs": 5504
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Can you see if that's a paid gig?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 5506,
      "endMs": 7339
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Fxx presents it's always sunny in Philadelphia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 12879,
      "endMs": 16782
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 52519,
      "endMs": 53752
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Uh, let's get started.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 53754,
      "endMs": 55320
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "What do you guys want to know?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 55322,
      "endMs": 57723
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "¶ ¶",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 57725,
      "endMs": 59792
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "the circumstances surrounding the death of the woman born Maureen ponderosa captivated south Philadelphia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 80346,
      "endMs": 88287
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "She was discovered in an alley with a broken neck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 89623,
      "endMs": 92491
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "In 2013, Maureen had begun her transition to a cat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 95595,
      "endMs": 100132
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "And in her cat form, she went by the name bastet to honor the Egyptian god of cats.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 100134,
      "endMs": 105270
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "The story quickly became fodder for local media.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 106574,
      "endMs": 110409
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "So much for having nine lives.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 110411,
      "endMs": 111777
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "This cat did not land on her feet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 111779,
      "endMs": 113579
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "She landed on her neck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113581,
      "endMs": 115380
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Authorities soon focused on the suspicious nature of her death.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 115382,
      "endMs": 119952
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "My name is Lance girard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 119954,
      "endMs": 122621
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "I've been with the Philadelphia police department for 24 years, 12 of which were with the homicide division.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122623,
      "endMs": 128827
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "I've seen a lot of things.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 128829,
      "endMs": 130629
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "A man wants to turn himself into a woman?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 130631,
      "endMs": 132998
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Okay. Who am I to judge?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133000,
      "endMs": 135567
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "But, really, a cat?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 135569,
      "endMs": 138437
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "What's next? A watermelon?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 138439,
      "endMs": 140772
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "First thing we wanted to establish is to whether the deceased was acting strange.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 141842,
      "endMs": 145811
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Not like \"I'm turning myself into a cat\" strange.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 145813,
      "endMs": 148814
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "More like suicide strange.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 148816,
      "endMs": 151283
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "We learned that she was excited about an upcoming surgery, a, uh, reverse nipplectomy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 151285,
      "endMs": 156822
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "That's where they add more nipples.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 156824,
      "endMs": 158490
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "I guess...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159693,
      "endMs": 161326
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "I don't know... She wanted more nipples.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 161328,
      "endMs": 164296
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "The thought of that just makes me want to blow my lunch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 164298,
      "endMs": 167766
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Now, apparently, the ex-husband was on the hook for this surgery due to an alimony arrangement.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 167768,
      "endMs": 173372
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "He wasn't happy about it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 173374,
      "endMs": 175641
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "That's when he became our primary suspect.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 175643,
      "endMs": 177976
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Was I irritated by this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 177978,
      "endMs": 180679
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Yeah, of course I was.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 180681,
      "endMs": 182114
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "I mean, it was the most expensive procedure yet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 182116,
      "endMs": 184550
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "You know, but i-i remained supportive and, uh, kept my cool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184552,
      "endMs": 188854
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "And I never threatened her in any way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 188856,
      "endMs": 191423
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Now, due to the nature of this call, we decided to bring him in for questioning.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 209375,
      "endMs": 213845
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "And he cooperated.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 215749,
      "endMs": 217149
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Said he wanted to clear his name.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 217151,
      "endMs": 219551
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "He answered every question.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 231030,
      "endMs": 232898
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Even offered DNA samples.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 232900,
      "endMs": 235100
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Although he did request to draw his own blood, which is kind of strange.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 235102,
      "endMs": 239905
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Mr. Reynolds was forthright.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 257924,
      "endMs": 260792
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Charming, quite frankly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260794,
      "endMs": 262828
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "It wasn't until I reviewed the interrogation footage later that I saw it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 266532,
      "endMs": 271303
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Something very unsettling.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 271305,
      "endMs": 274273
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "24 years on the job, I'd never seen anything like it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 278745,
      "endMs": 283015
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Two hours.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 284984,
      "endMs": 287452
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Never moved.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 287454,
      "endMs": 289454
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Never blinked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 289456,
      "endMs": 292057
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Gives me goose bumps just thinking about it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 292059,
      "endMs": 295294
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "He had all the right answers, but my gut told me this guy was guilty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 295296,
      "endMs": 300465
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Of something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 300467,
      "endMs": 303068
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Did I kill Maureen? No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 304904,
      "endMs": 307272
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Am I glad she's dead? Sure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 307274,
      "endMs": 310909
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Maureen's family was convinced of Dennis's guilt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 314514,
      "endMs": 317816
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Maureen?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 317818,
      "endMs": 320252
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Maureen died three years ago.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 320254,
      "endMs": 322421
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Dennis killed bastet, all right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 322423,
      "endMs": 324423
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "And let me tell you something. He did us all a favor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 324425,
      "endMs": 327459
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "You ever seen a grown woman take a dump in a sandbox?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 327461,
      "endMs": 330996
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Despite conjecture, the question still remained: Was there anything in Dennis Reynolds' past that would suggest him capable of murder?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 330998,
      "endMs": 340172
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Testing. Testing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340174,
      "endMs": 341973
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Syphilis. Syphilis.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 341975,
      "endMs": 344443
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "That's... well, yeah...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 344445,
      "endMs": 347145
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Well, he kind of...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 347147,
      "endMs": 349348
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Snapped the neck, uh, off a crow one time a little bit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 349350,
      "endMs": 353352
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "But that... but that's not not normal right, you know?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 353354,
      "endMs": 356988
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "I mean, it was just like boys being boys. Yeah. That...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 356990,
      "endMs": 361193
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Look, we had a totally normal childhood, and...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 361195,
      "endMs": 364229
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Look, Dennis wouldn't hurt a fly. No way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 364231,
      "endMs": 365997
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Whatever Deandra says is bs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 365999,
      "endMs": 368033
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "She's probably just covering for him because she's afraid he's gonna snap her neck like that crow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 368035,
      "endMs": 372504
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "He didn't just snap it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 372506,
      "endMs": 374039
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "He broke the thing's head clean off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 374041,
      "endMs": 375674
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "It was gruesome.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 375676,
      "endMs": 377209
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "I still have nightmares about it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 377211,
      "endMs": 379077
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "And I'm old.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 379079,
      "endMs": 380245
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "She told you what?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 380247,
      "endMs": 382180
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "No, no, no, no. No, no.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 382182,
      "endMs": 383715
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Look... that crow was injured, and I was simply putting it out of its misery, while, yes, testing the tensile strength of a crow's neck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383717,
      "endMs": 392624
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Well, yes, there was another crow, but that's because i simply couldn't believe that a crow's neck could be that weak.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 393893,
      "endMs": 399297
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Well, yes, there was a third crow, and a fourth, if you must know, but who likes crows?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 400500,
      "endMs": 405337
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Look, if you can kill a crow, you can kill a cat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 405339,
      "endMs": 408039
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Cat, cat, cat...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 409042,
      "endMs": 411576
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "That's why I started recording all our conversations.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 411578,
      "endMs": 415914
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "I suspected frank was probably recording all of our conversations, because of course he would.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 462995,
      "endMs": 468133
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "But let me tell you something, he was no fan of Maureen's, either.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468135,
      "endMs": 471002
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "He was just trying to deflect attention, which is why I started recording all of our conversations as well.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 471004,
      "endMs": 477609
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "I could have worn a goddamn imax camera around my neck and he wouldn't have noticed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 477611,
      "endMs": 481179
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "The old bitch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 481181,
      "endMs": 482981
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "And I caught him saying some pretty troubling stuff.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 482983,
      "endMs": 485183
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "What are we watching here?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 485185,
      "endMs": 487953
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah. Cats, cats.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 487955,
      "endMs": 489321
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Is that me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489323,
      "endMs": 490755
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Cats. I'll tell you what to do with cats.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 490757,
      "endMs": 492657
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Who shot this thing? Dennis?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 492659,
      "endMs": 494359
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Here's what you do with cats.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 494361,
      "endMs": 496495
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Back in the sweatshop in 'nam, we found a cat, we tossed it right in the soup.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 496497,
      "endMs": 501199
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Those hungry bastards ate cat soup every day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 501201,
      "endMs": 504669
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "What's the worst thing that could happen?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 504671,
      "endMs": 506271
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Some little kid choke on a hairball and die.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 506273,
      "endMs": 509274
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "So then you toss him in the soup.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 509276,
      "endMs": 511176
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "I was making money hand over foot, literally.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 511178,
      "endMs": 513945
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Somebody lost a hand or a foot, I'd toss it in the soup.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 513947,
      "endMs": 517282
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Well, that's all a lie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 518886,
      "endMs": 520552
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Uh, there was no soup.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 521788,
      "endMs": 523555
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Nope.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 526125,
      "endMs": 527726
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "There's no sweatshop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 527728,
      "endMs": 529394
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Excuse me. I got to go to the can.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 532299,
      "endMs": 535467
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Investigators wanted to verify the timeline.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 602101,
      "endMs": 604402
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Dennis provided to authorities.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 604404,
      "endMs": 605870
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Like I told the police, uh, Mac and I were watching a movie back at the apartment, and then I went to the bar.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 605872,
      "endMs": 611776
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "That's true. We were watching operation dumbo drop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 611778,
      "endMs": 614312
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "We were doing this amazing thing that I came up with, where we watch an old movie, and then I turn the volume down really low and we make wiseacre remarks the entire time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 614314,
      "endMs": 623254
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Yeah, he didn't come up with it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 623256,
      "endMs": 624723
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "It's just mystery science theater 3000.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 624725,
      "endMs": 626091
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "It's a spin on that. It's exactly that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 626093,
      "endMs": 628293
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Well, there's no robots. So it's worse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 628295,
      "endMs": 630261
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Oh, come on, Dennis. It's funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 630263,
      "endMs": 631963
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "It-it's not funny. It's not funny at all, because you can never think of jokes on the fly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 631965,
      "endMs": 635600
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "H-he, like, pauses the movie to try and think of something funny to say, and then he never can think of anything funny, so he ends up just saying a line from borat or Austin powers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 635602,
      "endMs": 643942
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "It's super annoying and played-out, and it's not funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 643944,
      "endMs": 646244
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Well, uh, like this. \"Get in my belly.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 646246,
      "endMs": 648813
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "But you're never referring to anything when you say it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 648815,
      "endMs": 651816
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "\"Yeah, baby. Get in my belly.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 651818,
      "endMs": 653818
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Well, that's two different characters.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 653820,
      "endMs": 655286
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "That's Mike Myers. It's not Mike Myers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 655288,
      "endMs": 657355
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "It's... it's multiple characters that Mike Myers plays in-in the same movie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 657357,
      "endMs": 661993
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Multiple characters in the same movie?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 661995,
      "endMs": 663762
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "What is he, a wizard?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 663764,
      "endMs": 665864
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Look, it's funny, Dennis.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 665866,
      "endMs": 667265
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "It's not funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 667267,
      "endMs": 668767
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Are we done with this? Can we be done?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 668769,
      "endMs": 670602
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "I'm tired of saying the same things over and over again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 670604,
      "endMs": 672771
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Well, wait. Wh... hold... Dennis, d-don't leave without me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 672773,
      "endMs": 674806
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "I mean, dude, look, are you mad at me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 674808,
      "endMs": 677142
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Investigators could find no discrepancies in the timeline.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 677144,
      "endMs": 680378
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "But then...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 680380,
      "endMs": 682380
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "A twist.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 682382,
      "endMs": 684449
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "He totally could have done it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 684451,
      "endMs": 686217
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Now, supposably, Dennis didn't see Maureen that night, but remember that Maureen was once Dennis's...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 686219,
      "endMs": 693358
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "\"Wife. Very nice.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 693360,
      "endMs": 697228
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "That was borat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 699632,
      "endMs": 700965
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "It was Friday, payday.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 700967,
      "endMs": 705336
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Maureen always came into paddy's to pick up her alimony check, asap.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 705338,
      "endMs": 709841
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "To avoid confusion, it should be pointed out that in a bizarre twist, Deandra Reynolds refused to be a part of this documentary unless we allowed her to play Maureen in the reenactment.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 709843,
      "endMs": 721419
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "And Dennis always made a big show of getting her with the spray bottle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 722589,
      "endMs": 726758
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "You know, because cats hate water.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 726760,
      "endMs": 728160
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "So, you see, Dennis totally saw Maureen that night.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 730597,
      "endMs": 735366
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Charlie was there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 735368,
      "endMs": 736901
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Why hasn't he spoken up?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 736903,
      "endMs": 738369
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Probably because Dennis...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 738371,
      "endMs": 740271
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Intimidated him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 740273,
      "endMs": 742607
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Oh, I just thought it'd be more dramatic if I...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 744343,
      "endMs": 747378
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Oh, come on, come on. I didn't lie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 747380,
      "endMs": 748913
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "I just left out some facts that are insignificant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 748915,
      "endMs": 751516
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "And-and intimidate Charlie? Please. What am I gonna do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 751518,
      "endMs": 754352
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Call him on the phone and threaten him?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 754354,
      "endMs": 756821
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "No, I know. But, I mean, if Mac's gonna do it, then, you know, I'm gonna do it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 758958,
      "endMs": 762861
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "At this point in the interrogation, Christ, I was at a loss.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 904904,
      "endMs": 908907
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Further inspection of Dennis Reynolds' safe revealed a cache of suspicious items.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 943642,
      "endMs": 950048
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Awesome.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 950050,
      "endMs": 951983
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "So while Mr. Kelly's statements were clearly unreliable and would need to be thrown out, another breakthrough came: Autopsy results came back from the lab.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 991023,
      "endMs": 1002200
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Um...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1022221,
      "endMs": 1024255
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Look, is getting groomed like a cat by your ex weird?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1053552,
      "endMs": 1056387
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Yep.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1056389,
      "endMs": 1057422
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Is it illegal?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1057424,
      "endMs": 1058756
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "I wish.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1058758,
      "endMs": 1060992
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "The investigation was at a crossroads.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1060994,
      "endMs": 1063728
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Then another massive break.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1063730,
      "endMs": 1066864
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Dennis has an answer for everything.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1066866,
      "endMs": 1069067
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Well, answer me this: Where's the collar?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1069069,
      "endMs": 1074038
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Cats have collars.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1075408,
      "endMs": 1077742
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Maureen's body didn't have a collar on it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1077744,
      "endMs": 1081679
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Killers keep trophies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1081681,
      "endMs": 1083681
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Alls I'm saying, find the collar, find the killer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1083683,
      "endMs": 1088686
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "This is not the first time the collar came up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1088688,
      "endMs": 1093024
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Dee Reynolds had, oddly, made the collar an issue during filming.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1093026,
      "endMs": 1097295
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Hey. Stop!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1097297,
      "endMs": 1099130
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Stop! Stop with the squirting! Stop! Cool it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1099132,
      "endMs": 1101566
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "We said one spray and then my line.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1101568,
      "endMs": 1103167
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "I... it was in my contract that we talked...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1104603,
      "endMs": 1106070
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "I put one squirt in there for... on purpose.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1106072,
      "endMs": 1108573
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "And this collar! I... Th-there's something wrong with the collar. It's driving me nuts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1108575,
      "endMs": 1111976
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "It... is an actual flea collar?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1113712,
      "endMs": 1116714
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "You son of a bitch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1116716,
      "endMs": 1118216
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "I-i really think the water activated some kind of, like, chemical agent. My-my neck's burning.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1118218,
      "endMs": 1122320
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Was the flea collar actually burning her, as she claimed?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1122322,
      "endMs": 1126724
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Are you serious?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126726,
      "endMs": 1128059
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Yes, asshole! It was burning my skin!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1128061,
      "endMs": 1130228
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "You want to zoom in on this?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1130230,
      "endMs": 1131896
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Hard to say.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1131898,
      "endMs": 1133331
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "But maybe there was another reason she removed it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1133333,
      "endMs": 1136501
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Whatever Deandra says is bs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1136503,
      "endMs": 1138436
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "She's probably just covering for him because she's afraid he's gonna snap her neck like that crow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1138438,
      "endMs": 1142406
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Maybe Deandra didn't want to wear the collar in order to cover for her brother and to establish that Maureen never wore a collar at all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1144410,
      "endMs": 1152984
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "We then discovered something in this piece of footage that blew the doors wide open on this case.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1152986,
      "endMs": 1161092
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Was I a person of interest?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1161094,
      "endMs": 1163361
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1163363,
      "endMs": 1164629
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "I am an interesting person.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1164631,
      "endMs": 1166531
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "But at the end of the day, you know, I'm just some guy with a crazy ex-wife who fell off of a roof pretending to be a cat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1166533,
      "endMs": 1174205
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "That's the end of it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1174207,
      "endMs": 1175640
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "All my stories checked out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1175642,
      "endMs": 1177842
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "I was cleared. Case closed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1177844,
      "endMs": 1180878
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Find the collar, find the killer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1183715,
      "endMs": 1186684
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Find the collar, find the killer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1186686,
      "endMs": 1188286
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "'Cause a dog is who I am now!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1188288,
      "endMs": 1189654
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Hit the referee!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1189656,
      "endMs": 1190655
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Find the collar...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1190657,
      "endMs": 1192023
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "\"Very nice.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1192025,
      "endMs": 1194025
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Find the collar, find the killer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1194027,
      "endMs": 1196694
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "¶ ¶",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1196696,
      "endMs": 1199564
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "guys, this was an open-and-shut case that was shut months ago.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1206672,
      "endMs": 1209874
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "And Maureen never wore a collar. You guys put that there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1209876,
      "endMs": 1212643
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Well, yeah, we needed a big twist at the end to show that you're guilty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1212645,
      "endMs": 1216414
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "But I'm-I'm not guilty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1216416,
      "endMs": 1217748
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "What about the security footage of Maureen's death?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1217750,
      "endMs": 1219584
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "I mean, it shows her prancing around on the roof like an asshole, and then she just falls off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1219586,
      "endMs": 1223054
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "People don't want to see that, because it's hard evidence, you know what I mean? Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1223056,
      "endMs": 1226924
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Like, it's better to actually sit on that footage until, like, maybe episode ten, and then let people decide then if you're guilty or not.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1226926,
      "endMs": 1232697
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Ten episo... you're gonna do ten episodes of this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1232699,
      "endMs": 1235199
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Yeah, but then even then we would keep it vague.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1235201,
      "endMs": 1237401
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "I mean, 'cause that's entertainment, you know?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1237403,
      "endMs": 1239070
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Someone gets murdered, and then you make a show.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1239072,
      "endMs": 1241005
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "But you never give any actual answers, because that's what people love. No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1241007,
      "endMs": 1244275
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "You drag it out. You rake it all over the victim's family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1244277,
      "endMs": 1247111
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "It's sort of like eating a bag of chips, you know?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1247113,
      "endMs": 1248879
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "It's never gonna actually make you full, and at the end you're sick, but you want to go back for more.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1248881,
      "endMs": 1253551
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "You want more chips.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1253553,
      "endMs": 1255186
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Murder is chips. Okay, you know what, I don't know what you guys are talking about, but I'm gonna find these tapes, and I'm gonna destroy them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1255188,
      "endMs": 1260391
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Well, we have backups, so it... Oh, you know what? Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1260393,
      "endMs": 1262460
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "That could make a good episode, where he's destroying...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1262462,
      "endMs": 1264595
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Let's think about that, right? He's destroying the tapes...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1264597,
      "endMs": 1266364
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "You know what, that would be.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1266366,
      "endMs": 1268899
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "\"Very nice.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1268901,
      "endMs": 1270268
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Is that borat?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1271604,
      "endMs": 1273237
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Yes! See?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1273239,
      "endMs": 1274538
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "He gets it. He's laughing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1274540,
      "endMs": 1276641
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Yeah, 'cause I know he was doing an impression. He's laughing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1276643,
      "endMs": 1279377
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Okay, wait, uh, let me... Let me think of another one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1279379,
      "endMs": 1281212
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Let me think of another one. \"I'll be back.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1281214,
      "endMs": 1283414
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Oh... who is that? Who is that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1283416,
      "endMs": 1285683
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Captioned by media access group at wgbh",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1327626,
      "endMs": 1330695
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "who do girls want to have sex with more than anybody?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1332831,
      "endMs": 1334332
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Jugglers. Ju...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1334334,
      "endMs": 1336534
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Dudes who can, like, juggle things. I know what a juggler is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1336536,
      "endMs": 1338336
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Sunny. All new, wednesdays at 10:00.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1338338,
      "endMs": 1340871
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Only on fxx.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1340873,
      "endMs": 1342006
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "I am a very dangerous man to know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1345877,
      "endMs": 1351349
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Taboo. All new Tuesdays at 10:00 on fx.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1354152,
      "endMs": 1358289
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "Man seeking woman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1362861,
      "endMs": 1365296
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "All new, wednesdays at 10:30.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1365298,
      "endMs": 1367465
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Only on fxx.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1367467,
      "endMs": 1369100
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "I had a little, uh, kung pao chicken in my teeth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1376042,
      "endMs": 1378843
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Was it alive?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1378845,
      "endMs": 1381312
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "I look terrific now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1383315,
      "endMs": 1385149
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "So, is he crazy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1389020,
      "endMs": 1390755
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "He believes he's mentally ill.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1390757,
      "endMs": 1393824
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "But at the same time, part of him knows...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1393826,
      "endMs": 1396761
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "The power's real.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1398997,
      "endMs": 1400398
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Take an hour of his time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1408440,
      "endMs": 1411041
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Wow. Look at Stan's yard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1411043,
      "endMs": 1413611
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Someone's been busy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1413613,
      "endMs": 1415746
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "Clearly not in ours. Maybe Henry can do some work today.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1415748,
      "endMs": 1418883
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1418885,
      "endMs": 1420951
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "I forget your back is always bad this time of year.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1420953,
      "endMs": 1423454
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Only when there are leaves...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1423456,
      "endMs": 1425122
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "When did you wash this last?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1429294,
      "endMs": 1431328
    }
  ],
